    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600104/1006001040140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は咲耶のプロデューサーだからな\r\n何よりも、咲耶のことを１番に思っているんだ",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001040150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "クス。嬉しいことを言ってくれるね",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600104/1006001040150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は本気だぞ\r\nだから何か困ったことがあれば、何でも言ってほしい",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶の前に立ちふさがる問題を、\r\n一緒に解決していきたいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001040160,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "あ、ああ……ありがとう",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600104/1006001040160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001040170,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ……\r\nなんだか、照れてしまうな……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600104/1006001040170"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ファンだって、咲耶が無理をしてまでがんばる姿なんて\r\n望んでいないはずだ",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001040180,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "プロデューサー……\r\n本当にすまない……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600104/1006001040180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001040190,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "これ以上、みんなにつらい思いをさせてはいけないな\r\n今日は、ゆっくり休ませてもらうよ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600104/1006001040190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、それが１番だ",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "何か頼みがあったら言ってくれ\r\n今日はとにかく自分の体のことを１番に考えるんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001040200,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "じゃあ……その、さっそく頼みがあるんだが……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600104/1006001040200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001040210,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "もう少しだけ……\r\nここに、いてくれないか？",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600104/1006001040210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……それだけでいいのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "本当に遠慮しなくていいんだぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001040220,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "いや、今はそれが１番嬉しいな……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600104/1006001040220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001040230,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "本当にありがとう、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600104/1006001040230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001040240,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "けれど、せっかくのテレビ出演を\r\n無駄にしてしまって……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charAnim2Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600104/1006001040240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "一度仕事をキャンセルしたからって、\r\n今後の活動の場が減るわけじゃない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今までの自分の成果を思い出してみてくれ\r\n咲耶のがんばりのおかげで、これからもっと忙しくなるぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001040250,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ、じゃあ、体調が戻ったら\r\n今よりもっと頑張らないとだね",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600104/1006001040250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だからと言って、また無理しそうになったら\r\n今度は倒れる前に、俺が止めるからな！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶がファンを大事に思っているように\r\n俺も咲耶を大切に思っているんだからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001040260,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "あ、ああ……うん。ありがとう……\r\n本当に心配してくれているんだね",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600104/1006001040260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001040270,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……私も、プロデューサーのことは\r\n大切に思っている",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600104/1006001040270"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001040280,
